{"t":"Eremo's Island","s":"eremo-s-island-85374","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Eremos_isle_9d2c77.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Eremo's Island</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Eremos-isle\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"222\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Eremos_isle_9d2c77.gif\" width=\"231\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Eremo\">Eremo</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.5<br/>December 19, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Eremo's Island</b> is a small island located south-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> on which <a href=\"#/wiki/Eremo\">Eremo</a> lives. To access the island, go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a> and from there ask <a href=\"#/wiki/Pemaret\">Pemaret</a> (the ship captain) to take you to <a href=\"#/wiki/Eremo\">Eremo</a> (it is free to travel from <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a> to Eremo's Island).\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Eremo\">Eremo</a> sells Amulets of Loss for 50,000 gp, <a href=\"#/wiki/Protection%20Amulet\">Protection Amulets</a> for 700 gp and the blessing called The Wisdom of Solitude. Furthermore, he buys Broken Amulets for 50,000 gp. <a href=\"#/wiki/Eremo\">Eremo</a> can also teach spells to promoted players, one spell for each <a href=\"#/wiki/Vocation\">vocation</a>.\n</p></div>","quests":["pilgrimage-of-ashes-quest","the-shattered-isles-quest"]}